kernelet: carrier entry/exception/fault hooks, per-CPU slot, user-return, FPU, and exports

Adds carrier_event_hooks (on_syscall, on_resume, on_exception, on_kernel_fault, on_exit),
task_struct->carrier_hooks, SYSCALL_WORK_KERNELET, kernelet_switch_mm,
kernelet_attach_mm, kernelet_mm_alloc, kernelet_cpu_slot + kernelet_cpu_slot_gs_offset,
kernelet_return_to_user, kernelet_fpu_{restore_carrier,sched_in,reset_carrier},
and GPL symbol exports required by the endovisor (kernel_clone,
flush_tlb_mm_range, set_memory_ro/rox/rw, modules_disabled, get_vm_area,
vm_area_map_pages, vm_area_unmap_pages).

Signed-off-by: kernelet-in-Linux prototype <none@example.com>
